OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy and
OL,6,Fdamp during the evening and overnight,
OL,7,Fwith rain most likely in the northwest
OL,8,Fand with the south driest. Staying
OL,9,Fmild, with the warmth tempered a
OL,10,Flittle by the brisk wind.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSaturday:FRather cloudy during the
OL,13,Fmorning, with a little rain and
OL,14,Fperhaps the odd more showery burst.
OL,15,FBrighter into the afternoon with warm
OL,16,Fsunny spells and with the wind also
OL,17,Feasing.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
