OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FBecoming
OL,6,Ffine through Sunday, with variable
OL,7,Famounts of cloud thereafter, but some
OL,8,Fclear or sunny periods developing and
OL,9,Ftemperatures climbing. Some chilly
OL,10,Fstarts still likely at first. Mainly
OL,11,Flight winds.
